# Integrity contract: every receipt manifest in docs/ pins SHA-256 of the raw
# working-tree bytes. Text therefore must look the same in the index and in the
# checkout on every platform. Without this file, `core.autocrlf=true` (the
# Windows default) rewrote LF to CRLF on checkout and every pin drifted by
# 1,528 newline bytes.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` normalizes text to LF on commit and always checks it out
# as LF, so the bytes a verifier hashes are the bytes in the object database.
# A file that genuinely needs different bytes must be marked explicitly below.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never convert, always compare as bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
